  "bio": {
    "zh": "Canaro 錄音生涯幾乎橫跨整個探戈史：從早期樸素舊派到晚期更圓滑的風格。米隆加與華爾滋曲目數量龐大，舞會開場定調時很常被選用——輕快、易辨識、容易抓住拍子。",
    "en": "Canaro's recording career spans almost the whole history of tango—from early, plainer styles to later smoother sounds. His vast milonga and vals catalogue is a favourite for opening a milonga: clear, catchy, easy to feel the beat."
  },
  "sound_description": {
    "zh": "涵蓋面廣；後期偏圓滑、易跳。適合當「入門耳朵」與米隆加／華爾滋節奏練習的參考。",
    "en": "Broad stylistic range; later periods lean smooth and danceable. A good ear-training entry point, especially for milonga and vals grooves."
  },
